# Normalize text files in the repository so `git diff --check` reports real
# whitespace problems instead of line-ending noise.
#
# The board is stored with LF endings, so `text=auto` normalizes it without
# rewriting history. This matters because a CRLF file under `text=auto` would
# make every line of it read as trailing whitespace on any edit, which trains
# you to ignore the one tool that would otherwise catch a stray space in a code
# file.
* text=auto

# Generated build output and dependencies are never diffed.
node_modules/ -diff -mergebinary
dist/ -diff -mergebinary